<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-LEADING SPANISH LEAGUE SCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING SPANISH LEAGUE SCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading goalscorers in the Spanish</p>
<p>first division after Sunday's games:</p>
<p>21 - Ronaldo (Barcelona)</p>
<p>19 - Davor Suker (Real Madrid)</p>
<p>13 - Jose Ziganda (Athletic Bilbao)</p>
<p>12 - Oli Alvarez (Oviedo), Luis Enrique Martinez</p>
<p>(Barcelona), Alfonso Perez (Betis), Rivaldo</p>
<p>(Deportivo Coruna), Predrag Mijatovic (Real</p>
<p>Madrid), Raul Gonzalez (Real Madrid)</p>
<p>11 - Julen Guerrero (Athletic Bilbao), Juan Eduardo</p>
<p>Esnaider (Atletico Madrid), Christopher Ohen</p>
<p>(Compostela), Victor Fernandez (Valladolid)</p>
<p>10 - Corentin Martins (Deportivo Coruna), Salva Ballesta</p>
<p>Sevilla).</p>
